less in the six minutes of added time. Waldschmidt came agonisingly close in the 94th minute, but his effort whistled just wide of the post. Moments later, Sebastian Sebulonsen attempted a speculative long-range shot that failed to hit the target. The Heidenheim defense, anchored by Frank Feller 's safe hands, held firm to secure all three points on the road.",
